<title>UK: Peek Holdings forecasts 1.5 mln stg in H1.</title>
<headline>Peek Holdings forecasts 1.5 mln stg in H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British data and communications company Peek Holdings said a slowdown in funding for some of its clients would hit its performance in the first half of 1997 when it is expected to report a loss of 1.5 million stg.</p>
<p>The company reported pretax profit of four million stg during the corresponding period in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company' share price slumped 29 pence to 46-1/2 moments after its outlook was announced.</p>
</text>
